Fresh Child accepted-state plus hash-verified Parent audit: 2290773 checks, no errors. Complete Child fragment/chemistry audit: 1937474 checks, no errors. Complete independent Parent conditional-law/chemistry audit: 84322 checks, no errors. A focused canonicalization-boundary audit adds 5 passing checks. Combined 4312574 passing checks. Every log, trajectory, summary and formal execution source hash is joined. The sample audit was a bounded one-replica check of the same fixed-record reconstruction; the final full audit additionally checks actual cache-history and nonnegative enumeration timing.

